name: Smeared Joker — suit pairing
author: corpus
description: >-
  Smeared Joker makes Hearts and Diamonds count as the same suit, and Spades and Clubs
  count as the same suit. First-shop flush engine: makes 2-suit Flushes trivial and
  enables Flower Pot, Blackboard, Seeing Double.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - joker: SmearedJoker
    antes: [1]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
      boosterPacks: [0, 1]
should:
  - joker: FlowerPot
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: Blackboard
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
  - joker: SeeingDouble
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
  - joker: TheTribe
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 25
